#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:208
msgid ""
"Sets the zoom level on the Gantt chart. 'Hour' shows a range of several "
"hours, 'Day' shows a range of a few days, 'Week' shows a range of a few "
"months, and 'Month' shows a range of a few years, while 'Automatic' selects "
"the range most appropriate for the current event or to-do."
msgstr ""
"Leggt de Ansichtgrött för dat Gantt-Diagramm fast. \"Stünnen\" wiest en Reeg "
"vun Stünnen, \"Daag\" en poor Daag, \"Weken\" un \"Maanden\" wiest en Reeg "
"Weken oder Maanden. \"Automaatsch\" leggt dat Tietrebeet na den aktuellen "
"Indrag fast."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:215
msgid "Scale: "
msgstr "Skala: "

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:221
msgid "Hour"
msgstr "Stünnen"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:222
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Daag"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:223
msgid "Week"
msgstr "Weken"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:224
msgid "Month"
msgstr "Maanden"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:225
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automaatsch"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:231
msgid "Center on Start"
msgstr "Anfang in de Merrn"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:233
msgid "Centers the Gantt chart on the start time and day of this event."
msgstr "Sett Anfangtiet un -dag na de Merrn vun dat Gantt-Diagramm."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:238
msgid "Zoom to Fit"
msgstr "Topassen"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:240
msgid ""
"Zooms the Gantt chart so that you can see the entire duration of the event "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Leggt de Ansichtgrött vun dat Gantt-Diagramm so fast, dat Du dor de hele "
"Duer vun dat Begeefnis op hest."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:247
msgid "Pick Date"
msgstr "Datum utsöken"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:249
msgid "Moves the event to a date and time when all the attendees are free."
msgstr ""
"Verschufft dat Begeefnis na en Datum un Tiet, wenn all Deelnehmers Tiet "
"hebbt."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:256
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Nieg laden"

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:258
msgid ""
"Reloads Free/Busy data for all attendees from the corresponding servers."
msgstr ""
"Laadt de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers nochmaal vun de "
"tohören Servers."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:265
msgid ""
"Shows the free/busy status of all attendees. Double-clicking on an attendees "
"entry in the list will allow you to enter the location of their Free/Busy "
"Information."
msgstr ""
"Wiest de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers. Wenn Du op den "
"Listindrag vun en Deelnehmer dubbelklickst, kannst Du den Oort vun sien "
"Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen angeven."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:506
msgid "The meeting already has suitable start/end times."
msgstr "Disse Mööt hett al passen Anfang- un Enntieden."

#: koeditorfreebusy.cpp:513
#, kde-format
